    "Put these 3 files in your ComfyUI models folder:\n- minimax_h3_image_pruned_w4a8.safetensors  (diffusion_models)\n- qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors  (text_encoders)\n- minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors  (vae)\nPut your character LoRA in models/loras.\nNeeds ComfyUI 0.45 or newer. First run is slow (it loads every file); judge the second run.",
