   "widgets_values": [
    "1. Load the picture you want bigger.\n2. Optional: describe it in the prompt (a short line helps the model keep the right detail).\n3. Run. The result is 2x wider and 2x taller, saved in output/H3 Picture Upscale.\nKeep light 1 stops bright or dark patches where tiles meet. Denoise 0.1 (default) to 0.3: lower keeps the face as it is, higher adds detail but can change skin and age.",
    "tip",
    false,
    false
   ],
   "title": "How to use"
